1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
A buyer.

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,200
An agent buys.

3
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:03,600
In testnet USDC.

4
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,000
Basis Theory holds the key.

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,000
The buyer.

6
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,400
Its agent shops.

7
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,200
The spend service decides.

8
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,600
Through fixed tools.

9
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,000
It checks policy.

10
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,400
Keeps a ledger.

11
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,800
Seals approved intents.

12
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,800
Basis Theory checks five fixed rules.

13
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,400
Then accesses the key.

14
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,200
The merchant requests payment.

15
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,000
A facilitator submits it.

16
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
The chain settles.

17
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,600
The agent orders.

18
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:30,000
One and a half USDC.

19
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Then asks to pay.

20
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Payment required.

21
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,400
The service checks the terms.

22
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:39,600
Saves a nonce and expiry.

23
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:42,000
Then seals the intent.

24
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,400
The sealed intent enters Basis Theory.

25
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:46,400
The signer checks the seal.

26
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,400
Then all five fixed rules.

27
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:50,600
Only then can it sign.

28
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:53,000
The signature leaves. The key stays.

29
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,000
The service checks the signature.

30
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,800
Merchant records the claim.

31
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:58,200
Verified. Submitting.

32
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,000
USDC moves on chain.

33
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Confirmed. The receipt returns.

34
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,200
A separate request names an unlisted payee.

35
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,600
The seal passes. The payee fails.

36
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:10,000
Refused. No signature. No transfer.

37
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Pay the same order again.

38
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,000
The ledger finds its receipt.

39
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,000
One transfer. Same receipt.

40
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,600
Wallet key: Basis Theory.

41
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:19,200
Seal key: shared authentication.

42
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:20,400
Invoker: invoke only.

43
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,600
Management: operator only.

44
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:22,800
Provisioner: one-time use.

45
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:24,400
Agent: no buyer keys.

46
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:26,000
Merchant: no buyer keys.

47
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Policy decides.

48
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,500
The signer signs.

49
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:30,000
The chain settles.
